sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as EPP (ext-proc)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelSvr as Model Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Sidecar as pd-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker<br/>Dynamic
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8200/TCP HTTP
    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP/2
    participant Render as Rendering Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,ModelSvr: Flow 1: Inference Request (Gateway Mode)
        Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+, Bearer Token
        Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc gRPC stream<br/>9002/TCP, Self-signed TLS
        EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch CRDs + Pods<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        EPP->>ModelSvr: Scrape metrics<br/>HTTP/8000, Configurable TLS
        EPP-->>Envoy: Selected endpoint<br/>gRPC response
        Envoy->>ModelSvr: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000
        ModelSvr-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>Client: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/443
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Envoy,Decoder: Flow 2: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (P/D)
        Envoy->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/8000, Optional TLS
        Sidecar->>Prefill: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/Dynamic, Optional TLS
        Note over Prefill,Decoder: KV-cache transfer via<br/>NIXL RDMA/61005 or shared storage
        Prefill-->>Decoder: KV-cache (NIXL RDMA)<br/>61005/TCP
        Sidecar->>Decoder: Decode request<br/>HTTP/8200, Optional TLS
        Decoder-->>Sidecar: Streaming tokens
        Sidecar-->>Envoy: SSE streaming response<br/>HTTP/8000
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,Render: Flow 3: E/P/D Pipeline (Coordinator)
        Client->>Coord: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/8080
        Coord->>Render: Tokenize request<br/>HTTP/8080
        Render-->>Coord: Rendered tokens
        Coord->>IGW: Encode request<br/>HTTP/2 /80, EPP-Phase: encode
        IGW-->>Coord: Encode result
        Coord->>IGW: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/2 /80, EPP-Phase: prefill
        IGW-->>Coord: Prefill result
        Coord->>IGW: Decode request<br/>HTTP/2 /80, EPP-Phase: decode
        IGW-->>Coord: Streaming response
        Coord-->>Client: Streaming response
    end
